# Generated by Next on every `next dev` and `next build`, and its contents
# differ between the two (`.next/dev/types` vs `.next/types`), so a committed
# copy churns in every diff. Ruled 2026-11-14 after four sessions of restoring
# it. Safe to drop: tsconfig.json includes BOTH type directories directly, the
# project imports no static image modules, and `npm run typecheck` was verified
# green with the file absent. Next recreates it on the next dev or build.
next-env.d.ts
